Description: ⚡ AutoClicker / Touch (iOS)
  > Advanced high-performance auto-clicker and touch recorder tweak for jailbroken iOS devices.
  🚀 Overview
  AutoClicker / Touch is a sophisticated automation tool for iOS, designed for extreme speed and precision. Built with a modular architecture, it offers a
  seamless overlay UI to automate complex touch patterns, gestures, and repetitive tasks.
  ✨ Key Features
   * 6 Dynamic Tap Modes:
       * Normal: Standard precision clicking.
       * Hold: Automated long-press simulation.
       * Human: Anti-detection mode with micro-jitter and randomized timing.
       * Double: Rapid double-tap execution.
       * Sequence: Multi-point sequential automation.
       * ULTRA (⚡): Extreme-speed engine with 0.001s interval support.
   * Touch Recorder V1: Record complex multi-finger gestures and play them back with custom loop counts and speed scaling.
   * Professional UI/UX: A refined, draggable floating overlay with real-time status updates and haptic feedback.
   * Rootless Architecture: Native support for modern jailbreaks (Dopamine, Palera1n) on arm64 and arm64e.
  🛠 Technical Specifications
   * iOS: 14.0+ 
   * Architecture: arm64, arm64e (Rootless).
   * Build System: Theos (Modular Subproject Structure).
  📦 Installation
   1. Build the package: make package
   2. Install the .deb via Filza or Sileo.
   3. Open the AutoClicker app to configure global settings and target applications.
